      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name} Does `[UdonBehaviourSyncMode(BehaviourSyncMode.None)]` now cause this behavior?\n\nAccording to the docs, NetworkCalling won't work on the behavior anymore once that is set.  If so, could probably mark this finished.",
